## 4. Peta Sesi Implementasi untuk Antigravity (`v1.4.1` → `v1.5.0`)

Setiap sesi bersifat mandiri, memakai TDD *failing-first*, wajib menjalankan `compileall` + `unittest discover`, serta memperbarui `PROJECT_STATE.md` dan `CHANGELOG.md`:

| Sesi | Versi | Ruang Lingkup & ID yang Dicakup | File Utama Target |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **S1** | `1.4.1` | Amandemen kebijakan versi `A.b.c` & aturan (`U00`), rebrand `Misora: Story Editor` + dokumentasi arah produk (`U04`), audit baseline & verifikasi regresi blocker. | `__init__.py`, `misora.py`, `assets/splash.py`, `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `PROJECT_STATE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `tests/` |
| **S2** | `1.4.2` | Fondasi font & metrik: 2 preset Global/JP (`U16`, `U17`), folder font kustom Win32 `AddFontResourceExW` + `.gitignore` (`U18`), fix bug `self.prefs` pengukuran + optimasi *binary search* (`U15`), ruler horizontal konstan `Nunito Bold` + fix overlap `50d` (`U19`), line number sinkron (`U20`), kembalikan indikator karakter/overflow merah (`U06`). | `misora.py`, `core/font_manager.py` (baru/opsional), `.gitignore`, `tests/` |
| **S3** | `1.4.3` | Perombakan performa **All Script — Teknik A** (`U08`, `U-7`), fix bug bocornya window ke-3 (`_update_empty_state_visibility`), desain ulang **Dialogue Preview & All Script Preview** presisi ala Priconne dengan *clean-room* Pillow (`U-5`), dan **Paste Box Insert vs Replace** (`4.1`). | `misora.py`, `assets/` (helper frame clean-room), `tests/` |
| **S4** | `1.4.4` | Tata letak Ribbon & Header baru (`U09`–`U14`, `U22`, `4.2`), Left Drawer tombol kecil minimize/reopen (`U03`), Double-click `Search Results` (`U-1`), `Enabled Engines` ke `Translator` menu (`U-2`), panah `←` & ikon `refresh.png` MTL Drawer (`U-6`), kejernihan checkbox/radio (`U21`). | `misora.py`, `assets/icons/refresh.png`, `tests/` |
| **S5** | `1.4.5` | Speaker Jump siklik `▼` + Autocomplete rename gaya Google + proteksi lock & notifikasi (`U-3`, `U-4`), Console toggle Windows Terminal `Opsi B` (`U02`), dan About `"Support Me"` dengan *lazy-loaded* `Service.gif` + ikon Ko-fi/Patreon/PayPal (`U05`). | `misora.py`, `assets/icons/` (ikon crowdfund), `tests/` |
| **S6** | `1.4.6` | Menu top-level **`Tools`** + mesin **`Auto Word Wrap`** (`U07`, `4.5`): reflow sadar NGUI/`{playername}`/JP-EN/multi-segmen/Lock + 1 Undo batch, integrasi opt-in di `Import from XUAT` & `Import/Paste Script` + menu manual `Tools -> Auto Word Wrap...`. | `core/word_wrap.py` (baru), `misora.py`, `tests/` |
| **S7** | `1.4.7` | Engine Transaksional **XUAT Cleanup & Archival** (`U01` + kebutuhan arsip): klasifikasi applied / unique right-side / uncertain, opsi duplikat & linebreak, arsip Combined & Per-File + header *traceability*, pengaturan direktori & `.xuat.old` + peringatan `.txt`, `Debug > Safety` toggle, dialog pasca-import, hapus file kosong 2-tahap, & `Tools -> Clean / Archive XUAT...`. | `core/xuat_cleanup.py` (baru), `core/xuat_index.py`, `core/xunity_sync.py`, `misora.py`, `tests/` |
| **S8** | `1.5.0` | **Release Gate & QA Final:** Audit seluruh ID (`U00`–`U22`, `U-1`–`U-7`), verifikasi manual Windows (DPI 100/125/150%, Ribbon Cut, Paste Box Insert/Replace, All Script timing, XUAT cleanup/archive, font switching, console toggle), promosi `CHANGELOG.md` & bump resmi ke **`1.5.0`**. | `__init__.py`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `PROJECT_STATE.md`, `tests/` |

